  "name": "ArcSecs — Beyond Spacetime AI Corpus",
  "description": "Human-directed, AI-assisted independent theoretical physics research: book, five scientific reviews, 41 historical reports, twelve stipulated premises, and selected archived numerical and verification data. Conditional findings are not experimentally established. Original rights-controlled material is CC0; existing third-party rights are unaffected. No held-out evaluation set. The bundled release archive is the verified local distribution; hosted files and generated Croissant are not independently verified.",
